<text><![CDATA[<p><strong>Issue</strong> - Michael advised he was able to connect yesterday evening, but this morning received an authentication error. The Internet works fine.</p><p><strong>Resolution</strong> - Restarted VPN-SRV-02 service as per emergency change request.</p><p><strong>Additional comments</strong> - </p><div><div><span><hr /></span></div><div style=""><span class="tdwrap"><strong>2026-09-09 08:13:55 - <a href="sys_user.do?sysparm_view&#61;itil&amp;sysparm_query&#61;user_name&#61;beth.anglin" rel="nofollow">Beth Anglin</a></strong></span><span style="float:right;"><sup> Comments</sup></span></div><div style=""><span><span style="word-wrap:break-word;display:block;">Follow the Steps and Resolve the Incident.<br /><a href="kb_view.do?sys_kb_id&#61;435186b5474321009db4b5b08b9a7160" title="How to configure VPN for Apple Devices" rel="nofollow">KB0000008 : How to configure VPN for Apple Devices</a></span></span></div></div>]]></text>
